{c: Verse 1}
[Gm]Saawan [F]ke jhule [D#]pade hain
[D#]Tum [F]chale aao
[F]Tum [D#]chale aao
[D#]Tum [F]chale aao
[F]Tum [Gm]chale aao
[G]Aanchal na [F]chhode mera, paagal [G]huyi hai pavan
[G]Abb [C]kya karu [G]main jatan,
[G]dhadake [C]jiya [Gm]jaise [F]panchhi ude
[G]Dil ne [F]pukaara tumhe, yaado [G]ke pardes se
[G]Aati [C]hai jo [G]dekh ke,
[G]ham [C]uss dagar [Gm]pe hai [F]kabase khade
Jab ham mile piya, tum kitane naadaan the,        Ham kitane anjaan the,
baali umariyaa mein naina lade,        Saawan ke jhule pade
